<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 227-5 IN 50 OVERS V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 227-5 IN 50 OVERS V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 227 for five wickets in 50 overs after being put into bat by Sri Lanka in the fifth Singer World Series limited-over cricket match on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
